Package: LongitudinalLVM
Type: Package
Title: Full Information Probit Models for Longitudinal Ordinal Data
Version: 0.4.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Niccolò", "Cao", role = "aut"),
    person("Lorenzo", "Carvisiglia", role = c("ctb", "cre"),
           email = "131760713+lorenzocarvisiglia@users.noreply.github.com"))
Description: Fits confirmatory factor and latent growth models for longitudinal
    ordinal responses using the observed data likelihood. Supports Gaussian
    item random intercepts, measurement invariance restrictions and numerical
    integration by Gauss-Hermite quadrature, adaptive quadrature and
    quasi-Monte Carlo.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: fastGHQuad, stats, utils
Suggests: spacefillr
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: Fortran 2008
Collate:
    'data.R'
    'native.R'
    'quadrature.R'
    'fit.R'
    'cfa.R'
    'wu2016.R'
    'growth-rho.R'
    'growthFun.R'
    'growth-inference.R'
